me by sacrificing my power.

38
00:01:58,733 --> 00:02:03,813
That said, I think it's time we
continued our race, don't you?

39
00:02:05,033 --> 00:02:08,473
Don't let this guy get to
you, Kakyoin! Stay focused!

40
00:02:14,913 --> 00:02:15,743
Kakyoin!

41
00:02:15,973 --> 00:02:19,393
There, now his soul belongs to me.

42
00:02:19,873 --> 00:02:21,993
The poor fool admitted defeat.

43
00:02:22,693 --> 00:02:26,533
He finally realized that it was
pointless to continue racing.

44
00:02:29,013 --> 00:02:30,333
Still, I must say,

45
00:02:30,753 --> 00:02:34,988
