to ever make me perspire like this.

46
00:02:41,273 --> 00:02:42,833
Given its source material,

47
00:02:43,113 --> 00:02:47,289
this doll will make a most exquisite
addition to my growing collection.

48
00:02:47,853 --> 00:02:51,030
He was the very first opponent
to muster up the courage to

49
00:02:51,113 --> 00:02:55,054
conquer his fears and resist cracking
under such colossal pressure.

50
00:03:02,533 --> 00:03:06,073
I will treasure his good company always.

51
00:03:08,593 --> 00:03:09,423
Careful,

52
00:03:09,506 --> 00:03:11,410
it would be in the best interest of all

53
00:03:11,493 --> 00:03:14,317
