your emotions in check.

54
00:03:14,413 --> 00:03:16,413
Harming me is out of the question.

55
00:03:16,633 --> 00:03:20,810
You see, dying is something I simply
can't do if you want your friend back.

56
00:03:20,893 --> 00:03:23,270
Slipping on a banana
peel and hitting my head.

57
00:03:23,353 --> 00:03:24,693
choking on gum,

58
00:03:24,893 --> 00:03:28,950
or even suffering a heart attack from
the shock of popping a bag of popcorn.

59
00:03:29,033 --> 00:03:33,853
If any of those things sent me to
heaven, Kakyoin's soul would go too.

60
00:03:56,793 --> 00:04:00,610
The end of the night, and the
dark in the end of the night,

61
00:04:00,693 --> 00:04:05,273
the moon has been sent to
the moonlight in the sea.

62
00:04:05,793 --> 00:04:10,010
I don't know if it's
the word of the night.

63
00:04:10,093 --> 00:04:12,413
I'd never see the number of night.

64
00:04:12,793 --> 00:04:15,670
I'm still in my own way,
and I'm still in my own way.

65
00:04:15,753 --> 00:04:18,173
When I get to the end of the night,

66
00:04:18,833 --> 00:04:20,657
I'm running back in the battle,

67
00:04:35,073 --> 00:04:36,670
The end

68
00:04:36,753 --> 00:04:43,753
of

69
00:04:47,253 --> 00:04:48,113
the world,

70
00:04:50,913 --> 00:04:52,273
Keine Ahitzabe,

71
00:05:18,053 --> 00:05:19,950
Hora, What the? Hey!

72
00:05:20,033 --> 00:05:22,133
Hey, Jotaro, wait! What's this?

73
00:05:22,493 --> 00:05:23,493
Hey, Jotaro!

74
00:05:23,833 --> 00:05:25,330
Why the hell are you sitting down?

75
00:05:25,413 --> 00:05:27,370
We should be kicking Geppetto's ass!

76
00:05:27,453 --> 00:05:28,653
I'll play him next!

77
00:05:28,933 --> 00:05:32,345
Old man, have you ever actually
played any of these games?

78
00:05:32,473 --> 00:05:35,002
If not, the odds wouldn't
be in your favor.

79
00:05:37,853 --> 00:05:39,473
Stay out of it, old man.

80
00:05:39,753 --> 00:05:42,812
This isn't your average
game of gin rummy after all.

81
00:05:44,793 --> 00:05:46,313
We're playing baseball.

82
00:05:46,973 --> 00:05:49,650
That's the game I choose
to settle this once

83
00:05:49,733 --> 00:05:54,670
and for all as collateral
I'll bet my soul!

84
00:05:54,753 --> 00:05:57,970
All right then I would like to bet Kakyoin

85
00:05:58,053 --> 00:06:03,370
soul my stand Atum has released your arm

86
00:06:03,453 --> 00:06:09,130
you may thank me at your leisure now that
Kakyoin soul is in my collection there's

87
00:06:09,213 --> 00:06:13,850
no longer reason for me to keep your arm
in my stands' clutches and suffice it

88
00:06:13,933 --> 00:06:18,930
