we're playing my specialty!

92
00:06:34,473 --> 00:06:35,303
Darby!

93
00:06:35,386 --> 00:06:38,570
Just you wait the moment Jotaro
wipes the floor with you I'll

94
00:06:38,653 --> 00:06:41,690
throttle the life out of your
pompous ass and that is a promise!

95
00:06:41,773 --> 00:06:48,290
Oh that's

96
00:06:48,373 --> 00:06:49,203
a baseball!

97
00:06:52,953 --> 00:06:55,110
Doesn't look like he's
tempered with this game either!

98
00:06:55,193 --> 00:06:56,470
You're good to go!

99
00:06:56,553 --> 00:06:59,950
Before we begin you'll
need to pick your team!

100
00:07:00,033 --> 00:07:04,033
Jaguars

101
00:07:05,033 --> 00:07:05,863
Jaguars!

102
00:07:06,813 --> 00:07:08,073
