it, I'll choose the Red Dragons.

106
00:07:18,193 --> 00:07:19,233
Red Dragons!

107
00:07:20,913 --> 00:07:22,031
Offense or defense?

108
00:07:22,373 --> 00:07:23,693
Go on, take your pick.

109
00:07:25,373 --> 00:07:26,203
Offense.

110
00:07:26,286 --> 00:07:29,493
In that case, the Jaguars will bat first.

111
00:07:30,433 --> 00:07:35,374
Next, you can begin designing your own
players by drawing their faces on the screen.

112
00:07:36,093 --> 00:07:39,373
This handsome devil is Star Platinum.

113
00:07:41,493 --> 00:07:44,770
Now that we've gotten the
preparations out of the way...

114
00:07:44,853 --> 00:07:45,773
Playball!

115
00:07:48,873 --> 00:07:51,353
Jaguars versus Red Dragons!

116
00:07:52,413 --> 00:07:53,243
Playball!

117
00:08:01,153 --> 00:08:03,733
I've chosen number 15 as my pitcher.

118
00:08:04,093 --> 00:08:06,269
January 5th is my birthday, you know.

119
00:08:09,653 --> 00:08:11,253
Now, here we go.

120
00:08:11,673 --> 00:08:13,373
The pitcher is winding up!

121
00:08:14,773 --> 00:08:16,293
