122
00:08:18,033 --> 00:08:18,863
What?

123
00:08:21,013 --> 00:08:21,973
Strike one!

124
00:08:23,033 --> 00:08:26,053
Uh, hey, I don't get it! What's wrong?

125
00:08:26,313 --> 00:08:28,090
That was a pretty amateur move back there.

126
00:08:28,173 --> 00:08:33,114
It's great that you swung the bat and all,
but it was before he even threw the ball!

127
00:08:39,553 --> 00:08:41,593
Hey, what's this all about?

128
00:08:42,033 --> 00:08:45,050
There's no need for you to
practice your swing, is there?

129
00:08:45,133 --> 00:08:46,013
Hang on!

130
00:08:46,333 --> 00:08:50,633
Jotaro, is this the very first
time you've ever played this?

131
00:08:50,993 --> 00:08:54,287
In fact, have you ever played
a video game in your life?

132
00:08:55,093 --> 00:08:57,473
You answer me right now, Jotaro!

133
00:08:57,993 --> 00:08:58,830
Relax.

134
00:08:58,913 --> 00:09:01,031
I already know how to play baseball.

135
00:09:01,293 --> 00:09:03,764
I'll figure out the game controls as I go.

136
00:09:04,673 --> 00:09:06,513
What are you saying?

137
00:09:06,933 --> 00:09:10,010
In case you haven't noticed,
your timing is totally off!

138
00:09:10,093 --> 00:09:11,753
Your swings are pathetic!

139
00:09:12,153 --> 00:09:15,271
Don't lie, this is your
first time playing, isn't it?

140
00:09:24,453 --> 00:09:25,393
Strike two!

141
00:09:27,473 --> 00:09:31,010
And now you're actually swinging the bat
after the catcher has caught the ball!

142
00:09:31,093 --> 00:09:32,790
You don't know what you're doing!

143
00:09:32,873 --> 00:09:34,520
Dammit, Jotaro, I was right!

144
00:09:34,713 --> 00:09:37,630
You don't know a video game
from a hole in the ground!

145
00:09:37,713 --> 00:09:39,013
Strike! Better out!

146
00:09:40,793 --> 00:09:42,690
Jotaro, it's time to get serious!

147
00:09:42,773 --> 00:09:45,150
Stop trying to act cool
and use your blasted head!

148
00:09:45,233 --> 00:09:46,730
You bet your soul on this game,

149
00:09:46,813 --> 00:09:49,410
so if you think you can back
out due to lack of experience,

150
00:09:49,493 --> 00:09:50,323
think again!

151
00:09:50,406 --> 00:09:51,236
Good grief.

152
00:09:51,513 --> 00:09:53,910
This is the worst pep
talk I've ever heard.

153
00:09:53,993 --> 00:09:55,290
You should be more encouraging.

154
00:09:55,373 --> 00:09:59,250
Try something like, it's only the first
inning, you can still make a comeback.

155
00:09:59,333 --> 00:10:01,290
What the hell's going
through that head of yours?

156
00:10:01,373 --> 00:10:05,530
You can't possibly rely solely on Star
Platinum's reflexes to win this game,

157
00:10:05,613 --> 00:10:06,443
