by pretending to be an amateur,

167
00:10:25,473 --> 00:10:28,179
let me inform you that
it isn't going to work.

168
00:10:28,933 --> 00:10:31,650
I'd never be foolish enough
to let my guard down.

169
00:10:31,733 --> 00:10:34,610
Even if you were a helpless
child, it wouldn't happen.

170
00:10:34,693 --> 00:10:36,453
A soul is at stake.

171
00:10:37,573 --> 00:10:38,433
Old man.

172
00:10:39,873 --> 00:10:42,579
Since you wanted to know,
I don't have a plan.

173
00:10:43,533 --> 00:10:45,393
However, if I did have one,

174
00:10:45,633 --> 00:10:49,130
the only thing it would involve would be
knocking the nose straight off the face?

175
00:10:49,213 --> 00:10:53,930
of this condescending, overinflated douchebag
of a prick taking up space beside me.

176
00:10:54,013 --> 00:10:56,837
All I care about is getting
Kakyoin's soul back.

177
00:10:57,253 --> 00:10:58,833
I'll do whatever it takes.

178
00:11:00,993 --> 00:11:02,493
You talk a big game,

179
00:11:02,633 --> 00:11:05,610
but it's still the top of the
first inning and you have won out.

180
00:11:05,693 --> 00:11:07,293
The match is far from over.

181
00:11:07,573 --> 00:11:09,410
And since you haven't played before?

182
00:11:09,493 --> 00:11:13,573
You should know that if you fall
more than 11 points behind you lose!

183
00:11:18,093 --> 00:11:20,513
Second batter number three?

184
00:11:24,693 --> 00:11:25,523
Strike.

185
00:11:26,053 --> 00:11:28,873
Damn, he's getting even worse that time.

186
00:11:28,993 --> 00:11:31,450
