four-seam fastball, and strike him out.

207
00:12:35,393 --> 00:12:36,687
It's the first inning.

208
00:12:36,953 --> 00:12:39,273
Two outs, two strikes, and no fouls.

209
00:12:39,413 --> 00:12:40,884
Here comes my next pitch.

210
00:12:41,093 --> 00:12:41,975
Go right ahead.

211
00:12:42,453 --> 00:12:46,218
I've pretty much gotten the hang
of batting with the controller.

212
00:12:46,493 --> 00:12:48,213
Wait, what did he just say?

213
00:12:48,453 --> 00:12:50,100
I must have heard him wrong.

214
00:12:50,933 --> 00:12:53,168
What does he mean, got the hang of it?

215
00:12:55,153 --> 00:12:57,353
Surely he couldn't have...

216
00:12:58,573 --> 00:13:00,044
What is he talking about?

217
00:13:00,253 --> 00:13:01,353
What does he mean?

218
00:13:08,013 --> 00:13:08,843
What?!

219
00:13:08,926 --> 00:13:09,756
Jotaro!

220
00:13:10,173 --> 00:13:14,190
All right, I'm really starting to
enjoy this game. What in the...

221
00:13:14,273 --> 00:13:16,413
