231
00:13:36,233 --> 00:13:37,433
Hey, run!

232
00:13:44,613 --> 00:13:45,713
Home Run!

233
00:13:46,173 --> 00:13:47,473
It's a home run!

234
00:13:50,673 --> 00:13:52,553
Jotaro! Damn you!

235
00:14:02,953 --> 00:14:03,783
Jotaro!

236
00:14:03,866 --> 00:14:06,813
Did I really hear you
correctly? Say something.

237
00:14:07,213 --> 00:14:10,390
It sounded like you've pretty
much gotten the hang of batting.

238
00:14:10,473 --> 00:14:12,532
I don't feel like repeating myself.

239
00:14:14,753 --> 00:14:17,953
He was a beginner when we
started this game. And yet,

240
00:14:18,133 --> 00:14:22,721
